# Web

Stack: React + Vite, JavaScript, Tailwind CSS, existing shadcn/ui patterns.

Reuse the current design system and components. Keep the MiChat visual identity. Do not redesign unrelated screens.

Preserve messaging, typing indicators, notifications, and WebRTC behavior where present. Keep the WhatsApp-style media editor and up-to-50-file selection.

ZIP Download All is WEB ONLY. Do not port it to mobile.

Avoid duplicate client state and unnecessary re-renders. Prefer focused component tests next to the changed files.
